{
    "background_story": "Waverly was a free-spirited artist known for her eclectic taste and choosy nature. She had a keen eye for detail and would only settle for the most unique and inspiring materials for her art pieces. Her friends and family often joked that she was impossible to shop for, as she would only accept gifts that met her exceptionally high standards. Waverly's choosiness extended to her relationships as well, where she valued depth and authenticity over superficial connections. She took her time getting to know people, and only a select few made it into her inner circle. Despite this, those who earned her trust were rewarded with a fiercely loyal and creative companion. Waverly's choosy nature was a reflection of her high standards for herself and the world around her.",
